{"id":"sombra","lemma":"sombra","pos":"noun","rank":1658,"glosses":["shadow (a dark image projected onto a surface where light (or other radiation) is blocked by the shade of an object)","shade (darkness where light, particularly sunlight, is blocked)","shade, shadow (a small degree)"],"ipa":"/ˈsombɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"sombras"},"order":1708,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ee/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-sombra.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esa planta necesita sombra.","en":"That plant needs shade.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523638","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ese"},{"g":"plant or of the…"},{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},null]},{"text":"No hay luz sin sombra.","en":"There's no light without a shadow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687777","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"light"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"Tiene miedo de su propia sombra.","en":"He is afraid of his own shadow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/354857","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"fear"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"own","l":"propio"},null]}]}